<title>CANADA: Alberta Energy 1996 share profits down.</title>
<headline>Alberta Energy 1996 share profits down.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.65		   C$1.44</p>
<p> Net			 68,110		  110,200</p>
<p> Cash flow/shr	     3.82		     3.51</p>
<p> Revs		   1,120,000			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 104,900		   75,000</p>
<p>		  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Notes: Earnings and cash flow per share in 1996 relect the issue 36 million common shares.</p>
<p>Cash flow in 1995 included the contribution of the company's forest products division, which was sold. Earnings from that year reflected a C$37 million gain on the sale of the division.</p>
<p>AEC's net earnings in 1996 reflect amortization of the difference between the fair market value and book value of the Conwest acquisition.</p>
<p>Company full name is Alberta Energy Co Ltd.</p>
<p>((--Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
